{"title":"Off-hand","sourceTitle":"Off-hand/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Off-hand\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Off-hand (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Off-hand/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Mano Secundaria (84% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Off-hand/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Main gauche (84% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Off-hand/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Левая рука (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Off-hand/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"副手 (84% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Off-hand-slot.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/ac/Off-hand-slot.png/400px-Off-hand-slot.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"287\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/ac/Off-hand-slot.png/600px-Off-hand-slot.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/ac/Off-hand-slot.png/800px-Off-hand-slot.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"860\" data-file-height=\"617\" /></a><figcaption>O slot improvisado.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O <b>slot off-hand</b> é um slot de equipamento especial em Vintage Story. Equipamentos secundários conferem uma série de bônus ao jogador, enquanto o jogador ainda pode usar sua mão principal para segurar itens.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Os itens equipados no slot secundário desempenham uma variedade de propósitos. No entanto, equipar qualquer item improvisado <b> aumenta a taxa de fome em 20%</b>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span></h2>\n</div> \n<p>O slot secundário é usado pelos seguintes itens:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tongs\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tongs\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/4f/Tongs.png/25px-Tongs.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4f/Tongs.png/38px-Tongs.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4f/Tongs.png/50px-Tongs.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tongs\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tongs\">Pinças</a>, permite que os jogadores peguem objetos de alta temperatura.</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Shield\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Shield\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield-reinforced-round-woodmetal.png/25px-Shield-reinforced-round-woodmetal.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield-reinforced-round-woodmetal.png/38px-Shield-reinforced-round-woodmetal.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cf/Shield-reinforced-round-woodmetal.png/50px-Shield-reinforced-round-woodmetal.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Shield\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Shield\">Escudo</a>, fornece maior resistência a danos.</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Torch\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Torch\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f2/Torch-basic-lit.png/25px-Torch-basic-lit.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f2/Torch-basic-lit.png/38px-Torch-basic-lit.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f2/Torch-basic-lit.png/50px-Torch-basic-lit.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Torch\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Torch\">Tocha</a>, fornece luz.</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Lantern\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Lantern\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/14/Grid_Lantern.png/25px-Grid_Lantern.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/14/Grid_Lantern.png/38px-Grid_Lantern.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/14/Grid_Lantern.png/50px-Grid_Lantern.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Lantern\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Lantern\">Lampião</a>, fornece luz.</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ink_and_quill\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ink and quill\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/66/Inkandquill.png/25px-Inkandquill.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/66/Inkandquill.png/38px-Inkandquill.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/66/Inkandquill.png/50px-Inkandquill.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ink_and_quill\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ink and quill\">Tinteiro e pena</a>, permite escrever em livros em branco e transcrever o conteúdo dos livros para pergaminhos.</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hammer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hammer\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/8a/Hammer-copper.png/25px-Hammer-copper.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/8a/Hammer-copper.png/38px-Hammer-copper.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/8a/Hammer-copper.png/50px-Hammer-copper.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hammer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hammer\">Martelo</a>, permite ao jogador cinzelar blocos com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/chisel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/chisel\">cinzel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Chisel\" title=\"Chisel\"> </a></span> na mão principal.</li></ul>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><